{"id":"pueblo","lemma":"pueblo","pos":"noun","rank":389,"glosses":["town, village","the common people, the working classes","population, people"],"ipa":"/ˈpweblo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pueblos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-pueblo.wav","examples":[{"text":"El pueblo necesita tu ayuda.","en":"The village needs your help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516094","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"help, aid"}]},{"text":"Ella vive en el pueblo.","en":"She lives in the village.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552797","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Nuestra escuela está en este pueblo.","en":"Our school is in this village.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642085","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"},null]},{"text":"Ellos vienen del mismo pueblo.","en":"They come from the same village.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77690","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"thereof"]]},{"text":"El autobús paró en todos los pueblos.","en":"The bus stopped in every village.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34525","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"bus, coach"},{"g":"to stop, halt","l":"parar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}